Herstory Media recrute des testeuses beauté pour évaluer maquillage, soins, soins capillaires et bien-être avant leur sortie officielle. L'Oréal, Bioderma, Garnier, Make Up For Ever — recevez les produits à domicile gratuitement.\\\",\\\"datePublished\\\":\\\"2026-03-03\\\",\\\"dateModified\\\":\\\"2026-03-03\\\",\\\"image\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/images/articles/herstory-media-club-test-produit-beaute-maquillage-soin.svg\\\",\\\"mainEntityOfPage\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"WebPage\\\",\\\"@id\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/article/herstory-media-club-test-produit-beaute-maquillage-soin\\\"},\\\"author\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\"},\\\"publisher\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"Organization\\\",\\\"name\\\":\\\"Bons Plans Mania\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\",\\\"logo\\\":{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ImageObject\\\",\\\"url\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/icon.svg\\\"}}}\"}}],null,[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"{\\\"@context\\\":\\\"https://schema.org\\\",\\\"@type\\\":\\\"BreadcrumbList\\\",\\\"itemListElement\\\":[{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":1,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Accueil\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":2,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Test Gratuit\\\",\\\"item\\\":\\\"https://bonsplansmania.fr/categorie/test-gratuit\\\"},{\\\"@type\\\":\\\"ListItem\\\",\\\"position\\\":3,\\\"name\\\":\\\"Herstory Media Club — Testez des Produits Beauté Gratuitement (L'Oréal, Bioderma, Make Up For Ever...)\\\"}]}\"}}],[\"$\",\"$Le\",null,{\"activePage\":\"/blog\"}],[\"$\",\"main\",null,{\"className\":\"article-page\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"container\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"nav\",null,{\"className\":\"breadcrumbs\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"/\",\"children\":\"Accueil\"}],[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\"